WEBVTT

00:00:08.960 --> 00:00:11.760
"When I saw you by the apple tree,

00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:14.800
your bangs swept back for the first time

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:17.600
with a flowered haircomb,

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:20.060
I thought you yourself were a flower.

00:00:21.180 --> 00:00:24.140
You gently stretched out your pale hand

00:00:24.140 --> 00:00:27.520
to offer me an apple:

00:00:27.520 --> 00:00:29.730
in this pinkish fruit of autumn

00:00:33.570 --> 00:00:37.160
I felt my first stirrings of love."

00:00:45.830 --> 00:00:53.630
"Taisho Otome Fairy Tale"

00:01:57.950 --> 00:02:03.080
"Taisho Otome Fairy Tale"

00:02:04.290 --> 00:02:08.000
"Episode 7"
"Tamahiko-Sensei"

00:02:13.590 --> 00:02:16.260
The wind's gotten so much colder.

00:02:16.260 --> 00:02:18.380
Winter's right around the corner.

00:02:22.970 --> 00:02:24.510
Hey! I said no pushing!

00:02:24.510 --> 00:02:27.060
C'mon, big brother, I wanna see, too!

00:02:28.640 --> 00:02:30.900
Ow, ow, ow...

00:02:30.900 --> 00:02:32.060
It's you!

00:02:32.060 --> 00:02:34.020
--Ah!
--We've been spotted...

00:02:34.020 --> 00:02:35.780
Long time no see!

00:02:35.780 --> 00:02:38.820
What are you doing here, of all places?

00:02:38.820 --> 00:02:42.530
Would you give us more lessons?

00:02:42.530 --> 00:02:44.200
Pretty please?

00:02:46.160 --> 00:02:49.290
They've come this far--I can't say no!

00:02:49.290 --> 00:02:51.580
Just for a little while.

00:02:51.580 --> 00:02:53.710
Thank you in advance!

00:02:53.710 --> 00:02:55.210
What?!

00:02:56.090 --> 00:02:58.170
So you see...

00:02:58.170 --> 00:03:01.090
"buzz buzz"

00:02:58.170 --> 00:03:01.090
These are the kids I was teaching earlier.

00:03:01.090 --> 00:03:03.140
Oh, is that who they are?

00:03:03.140 --> 00:03:04.970
But...

00:03:04.970 --> 00:03:07.470
Why are there <i>more </i>of them?

00:03:07.470 --> 00:03:10.020
We told everybody about you, Richboy!

00:03:10.020 --> 00:03:11.940
You're a good teacher, aren't you?

00:03:11.940 --> 00:03:14.310
Do you really know <i>everything</i>?

00:03:14.310 --> 00:03:16.440
Sorry to drop by like this.

00:03:16.440 --> 00:03:20.240
We just really wanted you
to teach us again, sensei.

00:03:20.240 --> 00:03:22.280
Stop calling me "sensei."

00:03:22.280 --> 00:03:26.910
"Sensei" is what you call a respectable
person who leads others,

00:03:26.910 --> 00:03:28.790
and that's not me.

00:03:28.790 --> 00:03:31.460
No? Okay--"Richboy" it is.

00:03:31.460 --> 00:03:32.290
"Rich--"?!

00:03:32.290 --> 00:03:33.500
Tamahiko-<i>sama</i>!

00:03:34.580 --> 00:03:37.170
Here you go. You're all set!

00:03:37.170 --> 00:03:38.420
When did she...

00:03:50.390 --> 00:03:53.140
Yes, right. Which means?

00:03:53.140 --> 00:03:56.940
Oh, shop B is three <i>sen </i>cheaper!

00:03:56.940 --> 00:03:57.940
Right!

00:03:57.940 --> 00:03:59.780
Yay!

00:03:59.780 --> 00:04:01.490
Richboy, you're amazing!

00:04:01.490 --> 00:04:05.950
Tough problems are easy when
we think them through with <i>you</i>!

00:04:05.950 --> 00:04:08.490
"Wo-ow"

00:04:05.950 --> 00:04:08.490
Oh, really? That's... that's great.

00:04:16.210 --> 00:04:19.380
They seem to be multiplying.

00:04:19.380 --> 00:04:22.670
And why not?
You're good at teaching, Richboy.

00:04:22.670 --> 00:04:26.760
You go over things as many times
as it takes without getting mad!

00:04:26.760 --> 00:04:28.140
You're nice...

00:04:28.140 --> 00:04:32.810
Aw, knock it off.
This is stuff anyone could teach.

00:04:32.810 --> 00:04:35.100
Ooh, Richboy's blushing!

00:04:35.100 --> 00:04:36.860
Even his ears are red!

00:04:38.570 --> 00:04:40.150
Stop looking at me!

00:04:40.150 --> 00:04:42.530
C'mon, time for your lessons!

00:04:42.530 --> 00:04:44.990
--You there! Settle down!
--Wow... just look at how much these
children love Tamahiko-<i>sama</i>...

00:04:44.990 --> 00:04:47.570
--Wow... just look at how much these
children love Tamahiko-<i>sama</i>...

00:04:47.570 --> 00:04:49.120
Falling in love all over again?

00:04:49.120 --> 00:04:51.290
Oh, yes! I really am!

00:04:53.160 --> 00:04:54.830
It's <i>you</i>!

00:04:54.830 --> 00:05:00.000
I heard everyone was here studying,
so I brought provisions.

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:02.130
What's up, Tamahiko?

00:05:03.550 --> 00:05:05.590
--What's <i>she </i>doing here?!
--What's <i>she </i>doing here?!

00:05:07.510 --> 00:05:10.640
Okay, Yuzu and I are off to make lunch.

00:05:10.640 --> 00:05:13.020
Hang in there, kiddos!

00:05:13.020 --> 00:05:16.020
What?! Wait--why are we--

00:05:16.020 --> 00:05:18.520
Is she angling to do something
to Yuzu again?

00:05:19.860 --> 00:05:22.690
Stay and teach us, Richboy!

00:05:25.990 --> 00:05:27.780
Put more oomph into it!

00:05:30.830 --> 00:05:34.870
That's right--stomp that udon good,
give it some body.

00:05:34.870 --> 00:05:37.670
The kids are looking forward to it!

00:05:37.670 --> 00:05:40.000
Um, miss...

00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:41.920
Call me Ryo.

00:05:41.920 --> 00:05:45.720
R-Ryo-<i>san</i>, about Tamahiko-<i>sama</i>...

00:05:45.720 --> 00:05:47.720
Hmm? I like him.

00:05:47.720 --> 00:05:49.340
What a fast reply!

00:05:49.340 --> 00:05:52.510
And I think I like you, too.

00:05:52.510 --> 00:05:54.180
What? Why?!

00:05:56.480 --> 00:05:59.100
When I teased you about the bookmark,

00:05:59.100 --> 00:06:03.730
not only didn't you break down crying,
but you tore the thing to pieces.

00:06:03.730 --> 00:06:07.450
All while looking into my eyes as if to
say, "This won't change my trust in him,

00:06:07.450 --> 00:06:11.120
won't sully my feelings for him."

00:06:11.120 --> 00:06:15.750
That's when I thought, "Oh, she's not
just some pampered princess.

00:06:15.750 --> 00:06:19.120
She's one interesting girl."

00:06:19.120 --> 00:06:20.500
And I like that.

00:06:23.040 --> 00:06:26.010
So I'm sorry. I apologize.

00:06:27.420 --> 00:06:28.630
Ryo-<i>san</i>...

00:06:29.590 --> 00:06:34.680
We could <i>totally </i>hit it off as
Tamahiko's wife and mistress, right?

00:06:36.930 --> 00:06:40.100
We-- We could <i>not</i>! Come on!

00:06:43.230 --> 00:06:44.980
Thanks for waiting!

00:06:44.980 --> 00:06:49.650
My special futomaki sushi and
Yuzu's own Yuzu-stomped udon!

00:06:49.650 --> 00:06:51.990
Let's dig in!

00:06:51.990 --> 00:06:54.740
Everything okay, Yuzu?

00:06:54.740 --> 00:06:56.410
Great work today, Tamahiko-<i>sa</i>--

00:06:56.410 --> 00:06:58.500
Nice work, Tamahiko!

00:06:58.500 --> 00:07:00.120
Ryo-<i>san</i>!

00:07:01.880 --> 00:07:06.710
Yum! Your <i>futomaki </i>are
the best in Japan, sis!

00:07:06.710 --> 00:07:10.470
Eat up, now! There's udon, too.

00:07:10.470 --> 00:07:12.050
You've got rice on your face.

00:07:16.970 --> 00:07:18.680
Yuzu? What's wrong?

00:07:18.680 --> 00:07:21.900
Ryo-<i>san </i>is a good big sister.

00:07:21.900 --> 00:07:24.730
In front of her brothers, anyway.

00:07:24.730 --> 00:07:26.650
Big sister... huh.

00:07:28.690 --> 00:07:30.740
Thanks, Richboy!

00:07:30.740 --> 00:07:32.530
See you later!

00:07:32.530 --> 00:07:34.240
Careful getting home!

00:07:38.540 --> 00:07:43.580
Say, what's it like to find happiness even
when you were bought for money?

00:07:44.540 --> 00:07:45.750
Hey, sis!

00:07:48.590 --> 00:07:50.720
Race you to the woods!

00:07:53.640 --> 00:07:55.220
All right.

00:07:55.220 --> 00:07:57.350
Here goes! You won't beat me!

00:07:58.850 --> 00:08:01.270
Look out--I'm passing you by!

00:08:04.480 --> 00:08:07.440
Everyone's making such rapid progress.

00:08:07.440 --> 00:08:10.360
It just goes to show how
good you are at teaching!

00:08:40.930 --> 00:08:43.980
"Taisho 11 (1922) - December"

00:08:47.360 --> 00:08:48.520
I'll help.

00:08:48.520 --> 00:08:53.780
Oh, no, no! You relax and
read a book, Tamahiko-<i>sama</i>.

00:08:53.780 --> 00:08:55.860
It's faster if we work together.

00:09:00.700 --> 00:09:02.410
Thank you very much!

00:09:47.040 --> 00:09:48.170
Yuzu...

00:09:49.500 --> 00:09:52.050
You must be tired from all that cleaning.

00:09:52.050 --> 00:09:53.800
Just get some sleep.

00:10:01.680 --> 00:10:03.060
Good night.

00:10:09.900 --> 00:10:11.480
Damn--I overslept!

00:10:14.860 --> 00:10:15.900
Yuzu?

00:10:18.150 --> 00:10:24.740
♬ In the moonless sky I see them ♬

00:10:24.740 --> 00:10:28.960
♬ Tiny lights that twinkle so ♬

00:10:30.210 --> 00:10:34.460
♬ There, in those starry shad-- ♬

00:10:34.460 --> 00:10:35.460
Yuzu!

00:10:38.010 --> 00:10:41.510
What are you doing?
You're not dressed for this cold!

00:10:45.890 --> 00:10:47.930
Thank you...

00:10:55.820 --> 00:10:58.990
I was a little lost in my thoughts.

00:11:00.280 --> 00:11:01.490
Of what?

00:11:01.490 --> 00:11:03.120
Um, well...

00:11:06.160 --> 00:11:08.250
Actually, I...

00:11:10.170 --> 00:11:12.580
I turned 15 today.

00:11:12.580 --> 00:11:16.210
That means I could be
your bride at any time.

00:11:17.920 --> 00:11:20.430
What?! Today? Then--

00:11:20.430 --> 00:11:23.300
Wait... was today your birthday?!

00:11:23.300 --> 00:11:25.100
Yes...

00:11:25.100 --> 00:11:28.430
Wh-Why didn't you tell me?

00:11:28.430 --> 00:11:30.980
So last New Year's Eve, too...

00:11:32.730 --> 00:11:37.940
You know... I'd be happy
to be your wife like this.

00:11:45.280 --> 00:11:47.790
I... I can't marry.

00:11:50.870 --> 00:11:55.460
The only family I know is
my own indifferent one.

00:11:55.460 --> 00:11:57.750
It made me hardhearted--

00:11:57.750 --> 00:12:00.880
and unable to imagine what
a happy home would be like.

00:12:03.840 --> 00:12:06.600
You're too good for me.

00:12:06.600 --> 00:12:11.480
Compared to you,
me and my right hand are just...

00:12:11.480 --> 00:12:13.350
We're such a heavy burden.

00:12:13.350 --> 00:12:18.320
Someone like me is really better off
being alone his whole life.

00:12:18.320 --> 00:12:22.320
It's more fitting that I
should simply die quietly,

00:12:22.320 --> 00:12:25.570
not troubling anyone nor being troubled.

00:12:25.570 --> 00:12:30.540
--Tamahiko-<i>sa</i>--
--A man like that can't make you happy!

00:12:32.620 --> 00:12:34.330
But...

00:12:34.330 --> 00:12:36.040
I want to change.

00:12:37.500 --> 00:12:41.920
I want to be the kind of person
who turns toward joy.

00:12:44.050 --> 00:12:47.180
I've actually been considering
going back to school.

00:12:48.680 --> 00:12:53.600
I've written Father, asking if
he'd let me attend high school.

00:12:53.600 --> 00:12:55.810
I haven't heard back yet.

00:12:55.810 --> 00:12:59.980
But I want to study what I should
be studying--and grow.

00:12:59.980 --> 00:13:04.360
I'll find an occupation where I can
use my skills, and then...

00:13:07.910 --> 00:13:11.160
I just can't marry right now.

00:13:11.160 --> 00:13:13.120
But one day...

00:13:14.620 --> 00:13:21.090
Every day I'm happy because
you're so kind to me.

00:13:21.090 --> 00:13:27.640
I'm happy to see you enjoying
the meals I prepare,

00:13:27.640 --> 00:13:32.100
and I'm happy to let you
take a nap on my lap.

00:13:32.100 --> 00:13:36.190
Nothing this past year
has been a hardship for me.

00:13:38.230 --> 00:13:43.990
In fact, Tamahiko-<i>sama</i>, just being
by your side has made me happy.

00:13:43.990 --> 00:13:46.200
Every single day!

00:13:46.200 --> 00:13:49.780
That's why I want to be with you.

00:13:52.740 --> 00:13:55.000
What about you?

00:13:55.000 --> 00:13:56.000
Yuzu...

00:13:59.580 --> 00:14:00.840
I...

00:14:17.770 --> 00:14:20.360
They're soft! Oh so very <i>soft</i>!

00:14:20.360 --> 00:14:24.190
"thump thump thump thump"

00:14:25.490 --> 00:14:26.610
"bonnng"

00:14:26.610 --> 00:14:29.450
Oh! Hey! Th-The New Year's Eve bell!

00:14:29.450 --> 00:14:32.660
I-I-I guess we should g-g-get to sleep!

00:14:32.660 --> 00:14:34.490
G-G-Good idea!

00:14:42.460 --> 00:14:44.920
Today was another fun day, Richboy!

00:14:44.920 --> 00:14:46.920
See you later!

00:14:46.920 --> 00:14:48.470
Careful getting home!

00:14:52.050 --> 00:14:53.050
Richboy...

00:14:54.390 --> 00:14:55.810
What is it?

00:14:55.810 --> 00:14:59.810
I... want to tell you something, Richboy.

00:14:59.810 --> 00:15:01.440
Richboy...

00:15:01.440 --> 00:15:04.150
Thank you for all you've done.

00:15:04.150 --> 00:15:09.150
Hey, why so formal?
Sounds like you're saying goodbye.

00:15:09.150 --> 00:15:12.320
Mmm. I <i>am </i>saying goodbye.

00:15:12.320 --> 00:15:13.240
Huh?

00:15:13.240 --> 00:15:16.290
Soon I'll be leaving to be a hired man.

00:15:17.660 --> 00:15:22.000
I found this great place in Tokyo--
a real big shop!

00:15:23.130 --> 00:15:24.340
I see...

00:15:31.010 --> 00:15:32.260
Goodbye.

00:15:48.860 --> 00:15:52.410
Tamahiko-<i>sama</i>, the bath is ready.

00:15:56.580 --> 00:15:57.910
Tamahiko-<i>sama</i>?

00:15:59.120 --> 00:16:01.790
When I was his age,

00:16:01.790 --> 00:16:06.090
the idea of working to support one's
family never crossed my mind.

00:16:07.500 --> 00:16:11.800
I didn't know what to say to comfort him.

00:16:15.390 --> 00:16:17.510
What could it be at this hour?

00:16:21.390 --> 00:16:22.390
Ryo-<i>san</i>?!

00:16:23.190 --> 00:16:28.230
Ryo... Ryotaro's gone missing.
Did he come by here?

00:16:28.230 --> 00:16:29.480
Ryotaro?!

00:16:33.990 --> 00:16:35.490
Let's split up.

00:16:35.490 --> 00:16:36.490
Right.

00:16:37.660 --> 00:16:38.700
Ryotaro!

00:16:40.200 --> 00:16:41.750
Ryotaro-<i>kun</i>!

00:16:47.840 --> 00:16:50.800
Ryotaro... he's the one who protected me.

00:16:52.170 --> 00:16:54.380
No!

00:16:54.380 --> 00:16:56.640
Get away from my sister!

00:16:56.640 --> 00:17:01.770
You can't, sis! Selling yourself for
money--it'll only make you miserable!

00:17:05.100 --> 00:17:07.730
If anything happens to that boy...

00:17:09.980 --> 00:17:11.440
Ryotaro!

00:17:12.610 --> 00:17:14.650
Ryotaro!

00:17:14.650 --> 00:17:17.740
Tamahiko-<i>sama</i>! Over here!

00:17:29.090 --> 00:17:30.500
Of all places...

00:17:40.180 --> 00:17:42.310
Your sister's looking for you.
She's worried sick.

00:17:43.930 --> 00:17:44.980
Sis...

00:17:49.810 --> 00:17:54.740
Richboy... I... I...

00:17:56.240 --> 00:17:59.490
I don't wanna become a hired man!

00:17:59.490 --> 00:18:01.280
Ryotaro...

00:18:01.280 --> 00:18:07.920
I mean... if I do, I'll never be able
to come back home!

00:18:07.920 --> 00:18:12.380
I'll never see my sister and brothers
and father again, ever!

00:18:12.380 --> 00:18:15.130
I would <i>hate </i>that!

00:18:15.130 --> 00:18:17.590
As ineffective as I may be...

00:18:19.090 --> 00:18:22.720
Tough problems are easy when
we think them through with <i>you</i>!

00:18:23.770 --> 00:18:26.770
...I still want to do
all I can to help him!

00:18:26.770 --> 00:18:30.150
Listen, those are all lies.

00:18:30.150 --> 00:18:33.320
I'm embarrassed to say
that I've never worked.

00:18:33.320 --> 00:18:38.150
But since I was little,
I've seen lots of live-in help.

00:18:38.150 --> 00:18:43.330
If they work hard, they get time off
and can visit their family.

00:18:43.330 --> 00:18:45.120
One person who worked for us

00:18:45.120 --> 00:18:49.120
invited their family to Tokyo
and showed them around.

00:18:49.120 --> 00:18:51.580
You can do that?!

00:18:51.580 --> 00:18:55.630
That person and their family...
did they look happy?

00:18:55.630 --> 00:18:59.680
Yes, they sure did. And what's more,

00:18:59.680 --> 00:19:01.140
they looked very proud.

00:19:10.940 --> 00:19:12.190
Ryotaro!

00:19:14.190 --> 00:19:15.730
Ryotaro!

00:19:15.730 --> 00:19:17.530
I'm sorry, sis!

00:19:17.530 --> 00:19:19.780
I'm just glad you're all right!

00:19:19.780 --> 00:19:21.110
I'm sorry!

00:19:23.660 --> 00:19:26.330
Why are you two all over each other?

00:19:26.330 --> 00:19:28.410
You <i>pushed </i>us together!

00:19:29.660 --> 00:19:31.460
Ryotaro...

00:19:31.460 --> 00:19:34.920
You don't really want to be
a hired man, do you.

00:19:34.920 --> 00:19:37.380
If you feel that strongly...

00:19:37.380 --> 00:19:39.130
I'll go!

00:19:39.130 --> 00:19:42.180
I'll be fine! Just fine!

00:19:46.390 --> 00:19:48.770
"JNR"
"Sakura Station"

00:19:49.180 --> 00:19:52.150
Okay, then, sis--I'm off.

00:19:52.150 --> 00:19:54.690
Take care of everyone.

00:19:54.690 --> 00:19:55.690
Brother...

00:19:55.690 --> 00:19:56.820
Take care.

00:19:56.820 --> 00:19:58.530
C'mon, don't cry.

00:20:01.240 --> 00:20:02.160
Richboy!

00:20:02.160 --> 00:20:04.200
Tamahiko--and Yuzu!

00:20:04.200 --> 00:20:06.160
You came!

00:20:06.160 --> 00:20:09.700
Some caramels--
for you to eat on the train.

00:20:09.700 --> 00:20:12.210
Write if you need anything.

00:20:12.210 --> 00:20:13.710
Thanks!

00:20:13.710 --> 00:20:14.710
Hey, sis?

00:20:15.630 --> 00:20:18.250
I'm gonna work as hard as I can!

00:20:18.250 --> 00:20:21.590
Then I'll invite you to Tokyo,
so you <i>all </i>better come!

00:20:23.220 --> 00:20:25.470
I'll show you all the sights!

00:20:25.470 --> 00:20:29.680
We'll go to all kinds of places
and eat lots of yummy things!

00:20:29.680 --> 00:20:30.930
Right, Richboy?

00:20:30.930 --> 00:20:31.940
Right.

00:20:35.900 --> 00:20:38.440
Mmm-hmm! I can't wait.

00:20:39.650 --> 00:20:41.780
Hey, you finally smiled!

00:20:45.280 --> 00:20:47.030
Aw, you big baby.

00:20:50.660 --> 00:20:52.960
Thank you so much for everything!

00:20:52.960 --> 00:20:55.170
I'll be back, Richboy!

00:20:55.170 --> 00:20:57.090
No... sensei!

00:21:00.960 --> 00:21:04.260
The Ryogokubashi train is about to leave!

00:21:05.510 --> 00:21:08.430
K-Keep up with your arithmetic out there!

00:21:08.430 --> 00:21:09.430
I will!

00:21:12.560 --> 00:21:13.980
--See you later!
--Ryotaro,

00:21:13.980 --> 00:21:16.230
--See you later!
--take good care of yourself, now!

00:21:23.990 --> 00:21:26.160
See, Ryotaro...

00:21:26.160 --> 00:21:29.330
He never had our father's attention.

00:21:29.330 --> 00:21:33.460
He looks really happy to have had you
as a father figure, Tamahiko.

00:21:35.710 --> 00:21:38.670
Glad to have been of service.

00:21:40.380 --> 00:21:44.800
As usual, I have zero self-confidence.
And yet...

00:21:44.800 --> 00:21:47.550
Tamahiko-<i>sensei</i>!

00:21:48.350 --> 00:21:52.850
In the same way spring
arrives after a cold winter,

00:21:52.850 --> 00:21:54.890
I want to change, little by little.

00:21:57.310 --> 00:21:59.690
And one day,

00:21:59.690 --> 00:22:01.520
I'll be a man who can keep you safe.

00:23:38.750 --> 00:23:43.000
Tamahiko-<i>sama </i>has begun studying in
preparation for his return to school.

00:23:43.000 --> 00:23:47.840
I'm so happy to be able to be by his side.

00:23:47.840 --> 00:23:51.340
May he always have a smile on his face...
